{"id":"sib0vhwyj3shce79trslfldwg","title":"绿色化学与绿色工程的三组原则","originalTitle":"从反应瓶到流程图：绿色化学与绿色工程的三组原则","summary":"绿色化学与绿色工程分别提出了十二条原则，强调预防优于治理、原子经济性、低危害合成等理念。这些原则旨在从设计阶段减少环境污染，而非依赖末端治理。绿色工程进一步细化为九条原则，涵盖系统分析、生命周期思维和社区参与等。这些原则为化学与工程设计提供了新的视角，推动了可持续发展。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=52206&do=blog&id=1561735"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T06:43:02.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T13:47:35.075Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T13:47:35.075Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["论文发表"],"score":27,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e374011f-4fe1-44e5-a175-515de10e4ea1","title":"绿色化学与绿色工程提出新原则"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e374011f-4fe1-44e5-a175-515de10e4ea1","title":"绿色化学与绿色工程提出新原则"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fjTINiMuGUOk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}